return 'done';
`)},{id:"dsl.nodeVisibility",title:"部件显隐（底层 API）",api:"viewer.hierarchy.setNodeVisible",needsDsl:!0,description:"DSL visibility.set 的底层能力：按 { entityId, nodeKey } 隐藏语义节点子树，showAllNodes 恢复。",code:cl(`
